"""The 14-step SellMore flow shown in er-diagram.html ("The SellMore flow, from the start").

generate.py renders this into the page and checks that every table and column named here exists in
schema_def.py, so the flow cannot drift away from the real schema.

A step's `uses` is a list of (table, what happens there, columns).
`columns` is 'name: what it holds | name: what it holds | name'. Backticks in text become <code>.
"""

